Cost: one multiply per digit in, one divide per digit out, about the same
as before; roughly 5 KB of per-seed work is unaffected.

Output impact: identical for any run with an 8-character -s. For shorter or
absent -s, the ~8% of lanes that previously searched garbage now search
their correct seeds, so the printed set changes (gains real seeds, loses
